{"about_the_game":"<strong>SpaceKraft is a physics based spaceship simulation which you craft elements and explore the open world.</strong><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1703020/extras/8df187043f59b90c21a2e75f51497d54.poster.avif?t=1726593004\" width=600 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1703020/extras/8df187043f59b90c21a2e75f51497d54.webm?t=1726593004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1703020/extras/8df187043f59b90c21a2e75f51497d54.mp4?t=1726593004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>Docking Arm and Crane Rope</strong><br>Spaceship has a docking arm to hold and move objects precisely and a crane rope in the back to lift objects from planet surfaces.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1703020/extras/97c00ef6110a36ed11779f93033d9054.poster.avif?t=1726593004\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1703020/extras/97c00ef6110a36ed11779f93033d9054.webm?t=1726593004\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1703020/extras/97c00ef6110a36ed11779f93033d9054.mp4?t=1726593004\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1703020/extras/43a04783c64ddfc5123107f040ef9fcd.poster.avif?t=1726593004\" width=300 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1703020/extras/43a04783c64ddfc5123107f040ef9fcd.webm?t=1726593004\" type=\"video/web